\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. To us a child of royal birth,
\par Heir of the promises, is given;
\par The invisible appears on earth,
\par The Son of man, the God of heaven.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. A Saviour born, in love supreme
\par He comes our fallen souls to raise;
\par He comes His people to redeem
\par With all His plenitude of grace.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. The Christ, by raptured seers foretold,
\par Filled with the eternal Spirit's power,
\par Prophet, and Priest, and King behold,
\par And Lord of all the worlds adore.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. The Lord of hosts, the God most high.
\par Who quits His throne on earth to live,
\par With joy we welcome from the sky,
\par With faith into our heats receive.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

